    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the FInnish top-secret project to end all life by proving to the Finns that you are no german spy, but a real local! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 12 Sauna levels, meticulously crafted on real cottages and public saunas. Physics based L\u00f6yly throwing mechanics, and locals to meet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And indie passion project by one aspiring Finnish game developer. Consider this game a medicine against the high paced and confusing information age. Relax, throw l\u00f6yly, enjoy. And save the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the FInnish top-secret project to end all life by proving to the Finns that you are no german spy, but a real local! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 12 Sauna levels, meticulously crafted on real cottages and public saunas. Physics based L\u00f6yly throwing mechanics, and locals to meet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And indie passion project by one aspiring Finnish game developer. Consider this game a medicine against the high paced and confusing information age. Relax, throw l\u00f6yly, enjoy. And save the world.</p>",
